'''Ghostly''' is an [[Uncommon Weapons|uncommon]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing Roblox’s [https://www.roblox.com/catalog/10607480911/Paranormal-Party-Starter Paranormal Party Starter] hat and then joining [[Murder Mystery 2]] during the [[Halloween Event 2022|2022 Halloween Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the hat went offsale on November 2nd, 2022.

==Trivia==
* It was obtained in a similar way as [[SharkSeeker]] and [[Dartbringer]].
*This is the first knife to be obtained by owning an exclusive Roblox item, The second one being [[Void]].

